		<div id="mw-indicator-coordinates" class="mw-indicator"><div class="mw-parser-output"><span id="tpl_Coordinaten"><span class="plainlinks" title="Klik op de coördinaten om een plattegrond of satellietfoto te bekijken" style="font-size:87%;" id="mwAA"> <span typeof="mw:File" data-mw='{"caption":"Coördinaten"}' id="mwMg"><span title="Coördinaten" id="mwMw"><img resource="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bestand:Internet-web-browser.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Internet-web-browser.svg/40px-Internet-web-browser.svg.png?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Internet-web-browser.svg/60px-Internet-web-browser.svg.png?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Coördinaten" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" data-file-type="drawing" height="23" width="23" class="mw-file-element" id="mwNA"/></span></span> <a rel="mw:ExtLink" href="https://geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?language=nl&amp;params=51_25_14_N_5_28_26_E_type:landmark_scale:25000_region:NL&amp;pagename=Genneper_Parken&amp;title=text_coordinates" class="external text" id="mwNQ">51° 25<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNg">′</span> 14<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNw">″</span> NB, 5° 28<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOA">′</span> 26<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOQ">″</span> OL</a></span></span></div></div>
